# Canonical host redirect: www -> non-www (301). Cloudflare Pages supports
# absolute-URL sources in _redirects for host normalisation.
https://www.cartagenashoreexcursion.com/*  https://cartagenashoreexcursion.com/:splat  301!
http://www.cartagenashoreexcursion.com/*   https://cartagenashoreexcursion.com/:splat  301!

# HTTP -> HTTPS on the apex is handled automatically by Cloudflare
# ("Always Use HTTPS"). Kept here as a defensive fallback.
http://cartagenashoreexcursion.com/*       https://cartagenashoreexcursion.com/:splat  301!
